flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  classDef byhand fill:#1d2029,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#eceef1;
  S1["1. Permission is asked when the first nudge is due<br/>or Nudge is ticked, not at launch.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. The weekly passes 80% while a session feeds:<br/>'Weekly at 80%' (the percentage when it fires)<br/>with the countdown and the landing time, once<br/>per weekly window.<br/><i>by hand</i>"]:::byhand
  S3["3. 15 minutes before the 5h reset: '5h window ends<br/>in 15 min' with the percentage, once per<br/>window.<br/><i>by hand</i>"]:::byhand
  S4["4. No 5h nudge from a window the plan no longer<br/>has.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. Notifications denied: 'Notifications are off in<br/>System Settings' under Nudge, and under Reopen<br/>while it is on, in the accent, a link the<br/>keyboard and VoiceOver reach, said once.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. The click opens System Settings, Notifications,<br/>at tokenpanda.<br/><i>by hand</i>"]:::byhand
  S7["7. Notifications turned on in System Settings<br/>count at once: the note goes at the next open<br/>of the popover, and the next nudge is posted,<br/>no restart.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. No nudge comes from stale figures: an hour<br/>without a session and the nudges wait.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S1 --> S2
  S2 --> S3
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
